tiatives. Preferred Qualifications Experience in higher education, employer relations, workforce development, career services, or community engagement. Familiarity with Handshake, TeamDynamix, or similar CRM/event management systems. Knowledge, Skills & Abilities Strong interpersonal, communication, and networking skills. Project and event coordination experience. Ability to work independently while building collaborative partnerships. Commitment to student success and employer engagement. ‌ Posted Salary: ‌ Work Environment & Physical Demands:"
