      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-10\nPosted: Posted 25 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nPosition Title: Part time faculty ‌ Position Type: Fixed Term (Fixed Term) ‌ About the Role: Part time faculty for the Simulation Center ‌ Teach classes for the Simulation Center ‌ Work Environment & Physical Demands:"
