    "https://nku.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Highland-Heights-Ky/Part-time-faculty--College-of-Informatics_JR100072": {
      "title": "Part time faculty, College of Informatics",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-10\nPosted: Posted 25 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nPosition Title: Part time faculty, College of Informatics ‌ Position Type: Fixed Term (Fixed Term) ‌ About the Role: This is posting is to collect applications of those interested in teaching within the College of Informatics. ‌ The College of Informatics at NKU invites applications for inclusion in its part time faculty pool. The college seeks qualified professionals and educators who may be considered for part-time teaching assignments on an as-needed basis. Part time faculty provide instruction in support of the college's academic programs and are expected to create an engaging learning environment that promotes student success. Opportunities may be available across a variety of disciplines within the college, depending on departmental needs and course offerings. Submission of an application to this pool does not guarantee employment or an offer of assignment. Applications will be reviewed by academic departments as instructional needs arise. ‌ Work Environment & Physical Demands:"
    },
    "https://nku.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Highland-Heights-Ky/Clinical-Coordinator-Part-time-faculty_JR100272": {
      "title": "Clinical Coordinator/Part time faculty",
