    "https://nku.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Highland-Heights-Ky/Part-time-Faculty--Honors-College_JR100180": {
      "title": "Part-time Faculty, Honors College",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-07-14\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nPart time\n\nPosition Title: Part-time Faculty, Honors College ‌ Position Type: Fixed Term (Fixed Term) ‌ About the Role: The Honors College at NKU is seeking part-time adjunct faculty. Faculty members will teach honors courses. These positions report to the Associate Dean of the Honors College. ‌ Duties: Teach between three and nine hours (1-3 classes) of college writing and/or reading per semester. Provide support to students through office hours. Align assignments and curriculum with programmatic and university student learning outcomes. Required Education and Skills: Master’s or PhD 3-5  years experience teaching writing/reading at the college level and working with first-year college students Experience with interdisciplinary research and learning Ability to teach face-to-face at NKU’s Highland Heights campus Experience teaching writing/reading and/or working with first-year college students The pay for a three-credit varies slightly based on years of experience and education but is projected to be between $2700 and $3000 per three-credit course. Required Documents: Curriculum Vitae or Resume References Evidence of teaching effectiveness or teaching philosophy ‌ Work Environment & Physical Demands:"
